#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0507 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: A variable ending in DTF must have a label that ends with "Imputation Flag" (or "Imput. Flag") and contains "Date"
#note "CDISC's own ADaMIG labels: ADTF spells Imputation in full, PHEDTF abbreviates to "Imput.", and DTHDTF / TRTEDTF interleave words between "Date" and the suffix -> all accepted"
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#library column-order ADLBC STUDYID USUBJID PARAMCD
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *DTF name=*DTF label="{Date Imputation Flag}"
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *SDTF name=*SDTF label="{Start Date Imputation Flag}"
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *EDTF name=*EDTF label="{End Date Imputation Flag}"
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col ADTF type=Char label="Analysis Date Imputation Flag"
col PHEDTF type=Char label="Phase End Date Imput. Flag"
col DTHDTF type=Char label="Date of Death Imputation Flag"
col TRTEDTF type=Char label="Date of Last Exposure Imput. Flag"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | x | x | x | x
---
